    "chunk_text": "Wi\u00f0 heafodwr\u00e6ce, genim hamorwyrt & efenlastan ny\u00f0owearde, cnuca, lege on cla\u00f0, gnid in w\u00e6ter, Wi\u00f0 heafodwr\u00e6ce, hindh\u00e6le\u00f0a & grundeswylgean & f\u00e6ncyrsan & gi\u00f0rifan wyl in w\u00e6tere, l\u00e6t reocan Wi\u00f0 heafodw\u00e6rce, betan wyrtruman, cnuca mid hunige, awring, do \u00fe\u00e6t seaw on \u00fe\u00e6t neb, gelicge To heafodsealfe & to ehsealfe, aluwan, gegnid in eced, smyre \u00fe\u00e6t heafod mid & in \u00fea eagan do. Eahsealf, win & piper, do in horn, & in \u00fea eagan \u00feonne \u00feu \u00f0e restan wille. Eahsealf, genim streawberian ny\u00feewearde & pipor, do in cla\u00f0, bebind, lege on gesweted win, drype of Gif eagan forsetene beo\u00f0, genim hr\u00e6fnes geallan & hwitm\u00e6ringc, wudulehtric & leaxes geallan, do \u00deis is seo seleste eahsealf, nim doran hunig & foxes smero & rahdeores mearh, m\u00e6ng tosomne. Gif poc sy on eagan, nim m\u00e6rcsapan & hinde meolc, m\u00e6ng tosomne & & swingc, l\u00e6t standan o\u00f0 hit \u00deis is seo \u00e6\u00f0eleste eahsealf, wi\u00f0 eahwyrce & wi\u00f0 miste, & wi\u00f0 w\u00e6nne, & wi\u00f0 weormum, & wi\u00f0 Wi\u00f0 hwostan, nim huniges tear & merces s\u00e6d & diles s\u00e6d, cnuca \u00fea s\u00e6d smale, m\u00e6ng \u00f0icce wi\u00f0 Wi\u00f0 eagena dymnesse, nim wulfes camb neo\u00f0eweardne & lege on hunig \u00f0reo niht, n",
